OL,3,GNEWSAHow political rivalry became
OL,4,Alifetime Rantzen friendship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire MP has recalled how a
OL,7,Fpolitical rivalry with Dame Esther
OL,8,FRantzen turned into a lasting
OL,9,Ffriendship, following her death at the
OL,10,Fage of 86.
OL,12,FNigel Huddleston first met the veteran
OL,13,Fbroadcaster and Childline founder when
OL,14,Fthey stood against each other in Luton
OL,15,FSouth at the 2010 general election.
OL,17,FBut what could have been an awkward
OL,18,Frelationship between political
OL,19,Fopponents instead became a friendship
OL,20,Fthat continued for many years.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
