OL,3,GNEWSAHow political rivalry became
OL,4,Alifetime Rantzen friendship
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Esther and I probably should not have
OL,7,Fgot on," the Conservative member for
OL,8,FDroitwich and Evesham said, adding:
OL,9,F"But, like so many people who met her,
OL,10,FI was completely charmed by her and we
OL,11,Fgot on like a house on fire from day
OL,12,Fone."
